OpenStax seed catalogs (CC BY 4.0)
----------------------------------
JSON catalogs under packages/domain/data/seed/ derive topic lists from
OpenStax textbooks published by Rice University. Those catalogs remain
licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0).
They are not relicensed as MIT. Per-catalog attribution lives in each
JSON file (publisher, title, license name, license_declaration_url).

